{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JXtxy8xeSd1794872470.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地首十個月跨境收支規模按年增長兩成，外匯市場交易量按年上升百分之9。</p><p></p><p>國家外匯管理局副局長李斌表示，10月以來，國際股市和債市延續震盪走勢，國際匯市相對穩定，內地外匯市場保持平穩運行。</p><p></p><p>10月份企業、個人等非銀行部門跨境收支合計1.45萬億美元，按月增長一成。外匯市場交易量3.77萬億美元，較9月日均增長百分之7。期內，跨境資金凈流入769億美元，較9月有所增加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.302616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T22:14:55.551274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:49.427734+00:00","content_hash":"b145b3d05a2f06f7715aa39eee564e1c76340be9d7ed362ed7967085549d32d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.302616+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}